sequenceDiagram
    participant ESP as ESP32-S3
    participant OBD as vgate iCar Pro

    ESP->>OBD: BLE scan + connect
    ESP->>OBD: GATT discovery
    ESP->>OBD: Init ELM327 (ATZ, ATE0, ATSP0)
    loop Khi IGN ON
        ESP->>OBD: Đọc PID 010C / 010D / 0105
        OBD-->>ESP: Trả telemetry
    end
